  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"xiangqingchakan\"> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">各院系：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:31.4pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">202</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">届毕业生与校领导合影将于</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">月</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman Regular\"\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">22</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">日（周一）上午</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">8:00-12:30</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">在主楼大厅举行。请各院系学生组、研工组负责统筹本院系毕业生组织工作，请各院系团学组织配合做好联络动员。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:31.4pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">参加合影的毕业生以院系为单位集合，按照合影时间安排和工作人员引导在主楼前西侧坡底处整队入场。毕业生应着装整洁、规范，男生服饰应有领有袖，女生应庄重大方；正装为宜，建议白衬衫、黑色长西裤，注意不应穿学位服参加此次合影。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:31.4pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">联系人：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:31.4pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">林涛  010-62785469</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:31.4pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">苗硕 17800804118</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:31.4pt; text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:31.4pt; text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:31.4pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">附件：</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">202</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">届毕业生合影时间安排与联络人名单</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:31.4pt; text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:right; text-indent:31.4pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">学生部</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:right; text-indent:31.4pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">研工部</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:right; text-indent:31.4pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">校团委</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:right; text-indent:31.4pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">202</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">年</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">月</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">8</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\">日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n</div>",
  "contentText": "各院系： 202 6 届毕业生与校领导合影将于 6 月 22 日（周一）上午 8:00-12:30 在主楼大厅举行。请各院系学生组、研工组负责统筹本院系毕业生组织工作，请各院系团学组织配合做好联络动员。 参加合影的毕业生以院系为单位集合，按照合影时间安排和工作人员引导在主楼前西侧坡底处整队入场。毕业生应着装整洁、规范，男生服饰应有领有袖，女生应庄重大方；正装为宜，建议白衬衫、黑色长西裤，注意不应穿学位服参加此次合影。 联系人： 林涛 010-62785469 苗硕 17800804118 附件： 202 6 届毕业生合影时间安排与联络人名单 学生部 研工部 校团委 202 6 年 6 月 1 8 日",
